  "description": "What the S&P, VIX, and recession-resistant stocks are actually saying",
  "body_html": "<p><strong>Watch the video.</strong> I said everything there so you don’t have to read, but here are the key takeaways:</p><p><strong>1. Ignore the news.</strong><br>Over-consuming headlines will drain you mentally, emotionally, and more often than people admit, financially. Constant negative news creates bad decisions.</p><p><strong>2. Recession-resistant stocks keep working.</strong><br>Copper, silver, and “new communications” names (satellites) are holding up on both green and red days.<br>Planet Labs, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$PL&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>   is now up <strong>60%+</strong>, confirming relative strength.</p><p><strong>3. The S&amp;P 500 gap-down is a </strong><em><strong>warning</strong></em><strong>, not a breakdown.</strong><br>No major trends are broken, but the <strong>VIX is spiking</strong>. In this environment, my strategy is simple: <strong>pause and do nothing</strong>.<br>I’m not adding risk here and may trim some tech if Tuesday’s selling continues.</p><p><strong>4. Legacy finance is on my radar 👀</strong><br>If you missed my <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/only-10-stocks-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">ETF Research Article</a>, go read it. I see multiple high-quality setups forming, and I expect buy alerts there soon.</p><p><strong>Bottom line:</strong> I’m not overly concerned, at this point in time. More updates to follow</p><p>If this helped, <strong>like ❤️, re-stack, and share</strong>.<br>Agree or disagree, this is how we beat out the mountains of AI slop and its good we all communicate with each other. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/unnecessary-stock-market-panic?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/unnecessary-stock-market-panic?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Summary</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-stocktok-playbook-everything?r=4z8lgl\">The StockTok Playbook</a></strong></em> <em><strong>|</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Resources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
